embed.description:
This is an example version of what the staff would receive in the logs.

The user would receive only the user portion of this ticket. 

<#{staff_channel}> | [Shareable Transcript](<{ts4.response.url}>) | {BGVAR_transcript_timestamp[{user_channel}]}

<#{user_channel}> | [Shareable Transcript](<{ts2.response.url}>) | {BGVAR_transcript_timestamp[{user_channel}]}

Something else to mention, older tickets can always be reopened by staff as well!

